WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
AI underwriting is coming.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.600
So is the liability.

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.600
Banks hire outside auditors for a reason.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.500
An independent party
stands behind the check.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.200
AI credit decisions need the same.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:17.600
When one goes wrong, you must show
it was tested independently.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.400
Today, there is no neutral test.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.700
Every vendor grades its own homework.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.300
UWBench will be that test.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:26.600
Open.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:27.800
Neutral.

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:30.800
Same cases and same rules
for every tool.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
The standard is being written now.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.300
Whoever sits at the table shapes it.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.900
There are only three to five
founding seats.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:40.200
Each one comes with a board seat.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.700
Founding members are named
in the research.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.400
They see their own scores
first in private.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:49.200
First public results
come by Q2 2027.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.900
After that, the rules are set.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.100
Take your seat while it is still open.
